sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant AUTH as Auth Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant CACHE as Redis Cache
    participant EMAIL as Email Service
    
    U->>FE: Login Request
    FE->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>AUTH: Validate credentials
    AUTH->>DB: Query user data
    DB-->>AUTH: User record
    AUTH->>CACHE: Store session
    CACHE-->>AUTH: Session stored
    AUTH-->>API: JWT Token
    API-->>FE: Authentication response
    FE-->>U: Login successful
    
    Note over U,EMAIL: User authenticated, now accessing protected resource
    
    U->>FE: Request dashboard data
    FE->>API: GET /dashboard (with JWT)
    API->>AUTH: Validate token
    AUTH->>CACHE: Check session
    CACHE-->>AUTH: Session valid
    AUTH-->>API: Token valid
    API->>DB: Query dashboard data
    DB-->>API: Dashboard data
    API-->>FE: Dashboard response
    FE-->>U: Display dashboard
    
    Note over U,EMAIL: Error scenario
    
    U->>FE: Request with expired token
    FE->>API: GET /protected (expired JWT)
    API->>AUTH: Validate token
    AUTH-->>API: Token expired
    API-->>FE: 401 Unauthorized
    FE->>EMAIL: Send password reset
    EMAIL-->>FE: Email sent
    FE-->>U: Please check email
